            "review_title": "Review at Bien 14 Buffet Seafood",
            "review_text": "AvgMom2Travel\nLong Island, New York457 contributions\n1\nCheapest Seafood Dinner We Ever had!\nOct 2025 • Couples\nConveniently located across the street from the port entrance where our cruise ship docked in Ha Long Bay, this restaurant offered fresh seafood. We stopped by in the afternoon and made our reservation for dinner that evening.\n\nThe restaurant was empty when we went back at 6 PM, but we were glad we made the reservation because everything was set up for us. The seafood dishes were well prepared and there were plenty of it. Although none of the waitstaff spoke English, the service was wonderful and very attentive. They even asked if we wanted seconds (translated through Google Translator)! The seafood fixed menu, which included dessert, cost 429K VND @ ($17) – unbelievable for the amount of food we got. (Drinks are extra - each glass costs less than a dollar.) Cash only. Highly recommended if your cruise ship docked in Ha Long Bay.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 28, 2026",
